# History of Science — Shorts cadence

Canonical: `00_Brand/Channel-Setup/HOS_SHORTS_CADENCE_LOCKED.md`

## Locked

- **Not daily Shorts** for launch / trust-building.
- **1 long / week** (Thu 19:00 UK, 8–9 min) when production is ready.
- **4–6 Shorts per long** over **7–10 days after** the long is public.
- Day-1 Short ~2h after long · then one every 1–2 days · never dump cluster · never Short before long public.
- Every Short: Studio **Related ▶** that film’s exact title (HeyHistorically pill).

## Do not

- Daily Short treadmill while the long pipeline is still forming.
- Orphan Shorts with no parent pillar.
